{
  "sn44.8:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 44.8 ",
  "sn44.8:0.2": "1. Abyākatavagga ",
  "sn44.8:0.3": "Vacchagottasutta ",
  "sn44.8:1.1": "Atha kho vacchagotto paribbājako yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavatā saddhiṁ sammodi. ",
  "sn44.8:1.2": "Sammodanīyaṁ kathaṁ sāraṇīyaṁ vītisāretvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. Ekamantaṁ nisinno kho vacchagotto paribbājako bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "sn44.8:1.3": "“kiṁ nu kho, bho gotama, sassato loko”ti? ",
  "sn44.8:1.4": "“Abyākataṁ kho etaṁ, vaccha, mayā: ‘sassato loko’ti …pe…. ",
  "sn44.8:1.5": "“Kiṁ pana, bho gotama, ‘neva hoti na na hoti tathāgato paraṁ maraṇā’”ti? ",
  "sn44.8:1.6": "“Etampi kho, vaccha, abyākataṁ mayā: ",
  "sn44.8:1.7": "‘neva hoti na na hoti tathāgato paraṁ maraṇā’”ti. ",
  "sn44.8:2.1": "“Ko nu kho, bho gotama, hetu, ko paccayo, yena aññatitthiyānaṁ paribbājakānaṁ evaṁ puṭṭhānaṁ evaṁ veyyākaraṇaṁ hoti: ",
  "sn44.8:2.2": "‘sassato loko’ti vā …pe… ",
  "sn44.8:2.3": "‘neva hoti na na hoti tathāgato paraṁ maraṇā’ti vā? ",
  "sn44.8:2.4": "Ko pana, bho gotama, hetu, ko paccayo, yena bhoto gotamassa evaṁ puṭṭhassa na evaṁ veyyākaraṇaṁ hoti: ",
  "sn44.8:2.5": "‘sassato loko’tipi …pe… ",
  "sn44.8:2.6": "‘neva hoti na na hoti tathāgato paraṁ maraṇā’tipī”ti? ",
  "sn44.8:3.1": "“Aññatitthiyā kho, vaccha, paribbājakā rūpaṁ attato samanupassanti, rūpavantaṁ vā attāna�